### Featured Offer 预期价格（2022-05-01）
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/product-pricing/featured-offer-expected-price
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","body":{"requests":[{"uri":"/products/pricing/2022-05-01/offer/featuredOfferExpectedPrice","method":"POST","body":{"asin":"B000000000","marketplaceId":"ATVPDKIKX0DER"}}]}}

### 竞争摘要（2022-05-01）
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/product-pricing/competitive-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","body":{"requests":[{"uri":"/products/pricing/2022-05-01/items/competitiveSummary","method":"GET","asin":"B000000000","marketplaceId":"ATVPDKIKX0DER","includedData":["featuredBuyingOptions"]}]}}

### 商品价格（Product Pricing V0）
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/product-pricing/price
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","itemType":"Asin","asins":["B000000000"],"itemCondition":"New","offerType":"B2C"}

### 商品竞争价格（Product Pricing V0）
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/product-pricing/competitive-price
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","itemType":"Sku","skus":["SKU-001"],"customerType":"Consumer"}

### SKU 最低报价（Product Pricing V0）
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/product-pricing/listing-offers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","sellerSku":"SKU-001","itemCondition":"New","customerType":"Consumer"}

### ASIN 最低报价（Product Pricing V0）
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/product-pricing/item-offers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","asin":"B000000000","itemCondition":"New","customerType":"Consumer"}

### ASIN 批量最低报价（Product Pricing V0）
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/product-pricing/item-offers-batch
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","body":{"requests":[{"uri":"/products/pricing/v0/items/B000000000/offers","method":"GET","MarketplaceId":"ATVPDKIKX0DER","ItemCondition":"New","CustomerType":"Consumer"}]}}

### SKU 批量最低报价（Product Pricing V0）
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/product-pricing/listing-offers-batch
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","body":{"requests":[{"uri":"/products/pricing/v0/listings/SKU-001/offers","method":"GET","MarketplaceId":"ATVPDKIKX0DER","ItemCondition":"New","CustomerType":"Consumer"}]}}
